--[[
    KIMS FISHIT HUB V1.0  |  ORIGINAL UI ENGINE
    For Roblox / Fish It (client-side Luau)

    V1 SCOPE:
    - Premium purple/cyan UI, touch + mouse dragging, responsive layout
    - Eight working navigation tabs, interactive UI preview controls
    - Minimize to a movable floating launcher
    - Save / load UI configuration, where executor file APIs are available
    - No remote scripts, no analytics, no network requests

    IMPORTANT: This is the approved V1 UI shell, NOT a fishing exploit.
    Every gameplay switch/action is a VISUAL PREVIEW ONLY and does not
    perform fishing, selling, teleportation, anti-AFK, or rejoining.
    Gameplay integrations require separate development and verification.
]]

